This code is actually incorrect because of the usage of "New_Ret" inside the Debug.Assert. "New_Ret" is an initialization of a local variable, it will never change its value. Debug.Assert evaluates the condition during the runtime, not at the compile time. In this case, for initializing test, it's better to remove it and write the actual condition accordingly. Below is the fixed version:

```cs
Debug.Assert(arrList.Count >= 0 && arrList.Count >= arrList.Count);
